 so someone should close it or mark it as a duplicate of INC-0002 and correct it.\n- **payments-api is still unhealthy:** It's still on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. It may be failing because of the worker problem and recover on its own now that the worker is fixed. If it doesn't, it may need its own rollback to v5.0.0, which would need approval since the first request was turned down. I haven't made any further changes to it.", "type": "text"}]}]}